# AICL Example: Winner by Score
# AX sub-language — compiles to real code.

Goal:
Higher score wins

Layer:
Core

Behavior Winner
    Input: p1_score, p2_score
    Output: result
    Action:
        if p1_score > p2_score:
            return "p1"
        if p2_score > p1_score:
            return "p2"
        return "draw"
